        "html": "<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"min-height:88vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;background:var(--bg,#FAF7F2);padding:0 clamp(24px,6vw,120px);box-sizing:border-box;\">\n  <div style=\"max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;width:100%;\">\n\n    <!-- 상단 레이블 -->\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:32px;\">\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block;width:36px;height:2px;background:#A0732A;\"></span>\n      <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.18em;color:#A0732A;text-transform:uppercase;\">Core Campus · Claude 자동화 시리즈</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 메인 헤드라인 (에디토리얼 좌정렬, serif 혼합) -->\n    <h1 style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(36px,6vw,76px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#1C1813;margin:0 0 28px;\">\n      팀원이 생겼는데,<br>\n      <em style=\"font-style:italic;font-weight:300;color:#A0732A;\">여전히</em> 직접 설명하고 있나요?\n    </h1>\n\n    <!-- 수평 구분선 -->\n    <hr style=\"border:none;border-top:1px solid #D9CEBC;margin:0 0 28px;width:100%;\" />\n\n    <!-- 서브카피 -->\n    <p style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(16px,2vw,20px);font-weight:400;line-height:1.7;color:#4A3F30;max-width:580px;margin:0 0 48px;\">\n      Claude 하나로 온보딩 SOP 전체를 자동화하세요.<br>\n      문서 작성부터 인수인계까지 — 반복 설명은 이제 그만.\n    </p>\n\n    <!-- CTA 버튼 그룹 -->\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n      <a href=\"#enroll\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#3A2B1A;color:#FAF7F2;font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.04em;padding:16px 36px;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;transition:opacity .2s;\">코스 시작하기</a>\n      <a href=\"#curriculum\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:#A0732A;text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid #A0732A;padding-bottom:2px;\">\n        커리큘럼 보기\n        <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">→</span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 소셜 프루프 하단 -->\n    <div style=\"margin-top:64px;padding-top:28px;border-top:1px solid #D9CEBC;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n      <div style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#1C1813;\">4시간</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#7A6E60;margin-left:6px;\">완성형 SOP 구축</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:1px;height:28px;background:#D9CEBC;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#1C1813;\">0장</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#7A6E60;margin-left:6px;\">수작업 문서</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:1px;height:28px;background:#D9CEBC;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#1C1813;\">100%</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#7A6E60;margin-left:6px;\">Claude 활용</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
