        "html": "<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"min-height:88vh;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;background:#1E1510;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n  <!-- 좌측 패널: 문제 제기 (다크) -->\n  <div style=\"padding:clamp(48px,8vh,96px) clamp(32px,5vw,72px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;border-right:1px solid #3A2C1E;\">\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\n      <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.22em;color:#8A7A68;text-transform:uppercase;\">Before</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <h2 style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(22px,3.5vw,42px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;color:#F5EFE6;margin:0 0 24px;\">\n      새 팀원이 올 때마다<br>처음부터<br>다시 설명합니다.\n    </h2>\n\n    <p style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(13px,1.4vw,16px);line-height:1.75;color:#9A8E7E;margin:0;\">\n      온보딩 문서도 없고, 프로세스도 없고,<br>\n      시간은 사라지고 팀원은 멈춥니다.\n    </p>\n\n    <!-- 고통 지표 -->\n    <div style=\"margin-top:40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\">\n        <span style=\"color:#6B5C4A;font-size:18px;\">✕</span>\n        <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#7A6E60;\">매번 구두로 반복되는 업무 설명</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\">\n        <span style=\"color:#6B5C4A;font-size:18px;\">✕</span>\n        <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#7A6E60;\">팀원마다 다르게 전달되는 기준</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\">\n        <span style=\"color:#6B5C4A;font-size:18px;\">✕</span>\n        <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#7A6E60;\">문서화에 쓸 시간이 없는 현실</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 우측 패널: 해결 (웜 액센트) -->\n  <div style=\"padding:clamp(48px,8vh,96px) clamp(32px,5vw,72px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;background:#2E2016;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n    <!-- 배경 장식 원 -->\n    <div style=\"position:absolute;top:-80px;right:-80px;width:320px;height:320px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,#C8893A22 0%,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;\"></div>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:24px;\">\n      <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.22em;color:#C8893A;text-transform:uppercase;\">After · Claude 자동화</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <h1 style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(24px,3.8vw,46px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;color:#F5EFE6;margin:0 0 24px;\">\n      Claude가 SOP를<br>대신 만들어줍니다.\n    </h1>\n\n    <p style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(13px,1.4vw,16px);line-height:1.75;color:#C4B49E;margin:0 0 40px;\">\n      4시간 안에 팀 온보딩 전 과정을<br>\n      완전 자동화된 SOP로 구축하세요.\n    </p>\n\n    <!-- 해결 지표 -->\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;margin-bottom:44px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\">\n        <span style=\"color:#C8893A;font-size:18px;\">✓</span>\n        <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#D4C4AE;\">Claude가 초안부터 완성까지 생성</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\">\n        <span style=\"color:#C8893A;font-size:18px;\">✓</span>\n        <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#D4C4AE;\">일관된 기준으로 누구나 동일하게 온보딩</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\">\n        <span style=\"color:#C8893A;font-size:18px;\">✓</span>\n        <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#D4C4AE;\">운영자는 코스 한 번으로 영구 자산 확보</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <a href=\"#enroll\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#C8893A;color:#1E1510;font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.03em;padding:18px 40px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;align-self:flex-start;\">지금 자동화 시작하기</a>\n\n    <p style=\"margin-top:16px;font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#7A6E60;\">코어 캠퍼스 · Claude 자동화 시리즈</p>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>",
