        "html": "<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"min-height:92vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--bg,#F6F0E8);padding:clamp(64px,12vh,128px) clamp(24px,8vw,200px);box-sizing:border-box;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n  <!-- 배경 대형 장식 타이포 -->\n  <div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(120px,22vw,280px);font-weight:900;color:#EAE0D2;letter-spacing:-0.06em;user-select:none;white-space:nowrap;pointer-events:none;line-height:1;\">SOP</div>\n\n  <!-- 컨텐츠 레이어 -->\n  <div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:720px;\">\n\n    <!-- 브랜드 레이블 -->\n    <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:40px;background:#E8DECE;padding:8px 18px;border-radius:100px;\">\n      <span style=\"display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#9B6A2F;\"></span>\n      <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#5C3D1E;letter-spacing:0.12em;\">코어 캠퍼스 · Claude 자동화 시리즈</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 서사형 헤드라인 -->\n    <h1 style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(30px,5.5vw,68px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.025em;color:#21190F;margin:0 0 16px;\">\n      한 번 만들면,<br>\n      <span style=\"color:#9B6A2F;\">팀원이 바뀌어도</span><br>\n      설명하지 않아도 됩니다.\n    </h1>\n\n    <!-- 이탤릭 서브 헤드 -->\n    <p style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(15px,1.8vw,20px);font-weight:300;font-style:italic;color:#7A6346;margin:0 0 32px;\">\n      Claude로 온보딩 SOP를 완전 자동화하는 유일한 코스\n    </p>\n\n    <!-- 구분선 장식 -->\n    <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:32px;\">\n      <span style=\"display:block;width:40px;height:1px;background:#C8B49A;\"></span>\n      <span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#C8B49A;\">✦</span>\n      <span style=\"display:block;width:40px;height:1px;background:#C8B49A;\"></span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 서사 문단 -->\n    <p style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(14px,1.5vw,17px);line-height:1.85;color:#5A4A36;margin:0 0 48px;\">\n      채용은 했는데 온보딩 문서가 없고, 매번 직접 설명하는 데 하루가 사라지고 있다면 —<br>\n      이 코스 한 번으로 그 반복을 끊어낼 수 있습니다.\n    </p>\n\n    <!-- CTA 블록 -->\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:16px;\">\n      <a href=\"#enroll\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#5C3D1E;color:#F6F0E8;font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;padding:20px 56px;border-radius:100px;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0.02em;\">4시간 안에 SOP 완성하기</a>\n      <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#A08870;\">커리큘럼 살펴보기 ↓</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 하단 신뢰 배지 -->\n    <div style=\"margin-top:56px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\">\n        <figure style=\"margin:0;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#E8DECE;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"문서 아이콘\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/placeholder/hero-badge-doc.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\" />\n        </figure>\n        <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#7A6346;\">완성형 SOP 템플릿 제공</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:1px;height:20px;background:#D4C4AE;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\">\n        <figure style=\"margin:0;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#E8DECE;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Claude 아이콘\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/placeholder/hero-badge-ai.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\" />\n        </figure>\n        <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#7A6346;\">Claude 프롬프트 전체 공개</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:1px;height:20px;background:#D4C4AE;\"></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\">\n        <figure style=\"margin:0;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#E8DECE;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"반복 없음 아이콘\">\n          <img src=\"/assets/placeholder/hero-badge-repeat.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;\" />\n        </figure>\n        <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#7A6346;\">반복 설명 완전 제거</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>",
